  "task_html": "<img src='/lerntheken/img/taxi.jpg' alt='Taxi' style='width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;max-height:200px;object-fit:cover;display:block;'><div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Lineare Funktionen im Alltag</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>Viele Alltagssituationen lassen sich als lineare Funktion f(x)&nbsp;=&nbsp;m&middot;x&nbsp;+&nbsp;b beschreiben:<br>&bull;&nbsp;<strong>b</strong> = Startwert (Grundgeb&uuml;hr, Anfangsmenge &hellip;)<br>&bull;&nbsp;<strong>m</strong> = &Auml;nderungsrate pro Einheit (pro km, pro Stunde &hellip;)</p></div><div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>Situation</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>Ein Taxi kostet <strong>3 &euro; Grundgeb&uuml;hr</strong> plus <strong>1,50 &euro; pro Kilometer</strong>.</p></div><div class='task-block task-orange' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe a) &ndash; Wertetabelle erg&auml;nzen</div><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#2563eb;'>Kilometer (x)</th><th style='background:#2563eb;'>0</th><th style='background:#2563eb;'>2</th><th style='background:#2563eb;'>5</th><th style='background:#2563eb;'>10</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='row-label'>Kosten f(x) in &euro;</td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='3' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='6' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='10.5' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='18' placeholder='?'></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class='task-block task-green' style='margin-top:12px;'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe b) &ndash; Steigung und y-Achsenabschnitt</div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px 0;'>Trage m und b ein.</p><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#16a34a;'>Steigung m</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>y-Achsenabschnitt b</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='1.5' placeholder='m'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='3' placeholder='b'></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(8)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(8)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-8'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;'><strong>a) Wertetabelle:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>f(0)=3 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; f(2)=6 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; f(5)=10,50 &euro; &nbsp;|&nbsp; f(10)=18 &euro;</span><br><br><strong>b) Funktionsgleichung:</strong><br>m = <strong>1,5</strong> (pro km), b = <strong>3</strong> (Grundgeb&uuml;hr)<br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>f(x) = 1,5x + 3</span></div>"
}
